---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="HVAC Boot Camp Pricing | $479 in Full or Monthly Payments"
  description="Compare the current HVAC Boot Camp price: $479 in full or $97 today plus six monthly payments of $97, $679 total. Textbook purchased separately."
>
  <div class="standard-page pricing-page refreshed-pricing">
    <section class="page-hero"><div class="page-hero-inner narrow-hero"><p class="eyebrow">HVAC Boot Camp pricing</p><h1>One current course. <span>Two ways to pay.</span></h1><p>Both options enroll you in the existing 27-module Moodle course. Choose one payment or a lower starting amount with a higher total.</p></div></section>

    <section class="page-section pricing-main-section"><div class="page-shell">
      <div class="pricing-grid pricing-grid-light">
        <article class="price-card featured">
          <p class="price-badge">Lowest total</p><p class="price-label">Pay in full</p><p class="price">$479</p><p class="price-detail">One payment. $200 less than the monthly total.</p>
          <ul class="price-list"><li>Existing 27-module HVAC Boot Camp</li><li>Moodle access, videos, and quizzes</li><li>Instructor course guidance</li></ul>
          <a class="button button-primary" href="https://www.hvactrainingsolutions.net/hvac-boot-camp/pay-in-full/">Continue to current checkout ↗</a>
          <small>Opens the existing website. Review its checkout and policies before paying.</small>
        </article>
        <article class="price-card">
          <p class="price-label">Monthly payments</p><p class="price">$97 <span class="price-suffix">to start</span></p><p class="price-detail">$97 today, then six monthly payments of $97. <strong>$679 total.</strong></p>
          <ul class="price-list"><li>Same existing 27-module course</li><li>Moodle access, videos, and quizzes</li><li>Instructor course guidance</li></ul>
          <a class="button button-dark" href="https://www.hvactrainingsolutions.net/hvac-boot-camp/monthly-plan/">Continue to current checkout ↗</a>
          <small>Opens the existing website. Review its checkout and policies before paying.</small>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="price-clarity"><strong>Budget for the textbook separately.</strong><p>The current course uses <em>Residential Construction Academy HVAC, 2nd Edition</em> by Eugene Silberstein. The purchase price above does not include it.</p></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="page-section soft-section"><div class="page-shell preview-split">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">What enrollment includes</p><h2>The paid course is the existing Boot Camp.</h2><p>Study the 27 modules in Moodle with textbook reading, Ron's teaching videos, and quizzes. The new five-part Unit 1 is a free preview of a redesign being developed, not the course unlocked by payment today.</p><a class="button button-outline-dark" href="/hvac-boot-camp/">Review the 27 modules</a></div>
      <div class="comparison-card"><p class="eyebrow">Check before checkout</p><div><strong>Full payment</strong><span>$479 today</span></div><div><strong>Monthly option</strong><span>$97 today + six payments of $97 = $679 total</span></div><div><strong>Textbook</strong><span>Additional purchase</span></div><p>Enrollment is currently processed on the existing website while the new marketing site is in development.</p></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="page-section"><div class="page-shell">
      <div class="section-heading center"><p class="eyebrow">Common questions</p><h2>Make an informed decision.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is the course different with the monthly option?</summary><p>No. Both options are for the same current Boot Camp. The monthly option costs $200 more in total.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is the textbook included?</summary><p>No. You buy the required textbook separately.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary>Does paying give me the new Unit 1 experience across all 27 modules?</summary><p>No. Unit 1 is a free development preview. The course currently delivered to paying students is in Moodle.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary>Does the course guarantee a job, certification, or independent field work?</summary><p>No. Hiring and credentials have separate requirements. Safe field skills require supervised practice.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary>Where can I confirm payment or refund terms?</summary><p>Review the terms shown by the existing checkout before paying, or <a href="/contact/">contact HVAC Training Solutions</a> with a question.</p></details>
      </div>
      <div class="center-actions"><a class="button button-outline-dark" href="/contact/">Ask a question first</a><a class="text-link-dark" href="/unit-1-prototype/">Try the free preview →</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
